contract_change:
  api: "pm release, pm claim refusals (claim_activity) and rendered recovery commands on Windows"
  before: "A release by the holder a close ended cleared a later holder (warn policy, or strict with --force) and a --handoff or --pause from it moved the later holder work; claim_activity had no activity state and text refusals called an unjudgeable holder active; cmd.exe recovery commands left %VAR% and inner quotes live"
  after: "That release writes nothing and warns release_claim_ended_by_close:<id>:<holder>, and a --handoff or --pause from it is refused with release_claim_ended_by_close before any write; claim_activity.state (optional for older producers) is active, stale or unknown, and text refusals print activity unknown with its cause; an argument holding % or a double quote renders in the cmd.exe caret form"
  migrate: "Read claim_activity.state instead of inferring activity from stale_policy.stale; treat the release_claim_ended_by_close warning as a successful no-op and the refusal as the later holder owning the item; to take a later holder claim, use pm claim <id> --force and then release"
body: ""
